# Transient verification screenshots written to the repo root by the render /
# screenshot checks (scripts/audit-doc-templates.mjs, hydration-check.mjs,
# mobile-regression.mjs, ticket-shot.mjs, ...) plus the document thumbnail
# cache. Never served — the site only serves from public/ — and reproduced on
# every check run, so they stay out of the repo.
# document-library-*.png is the one exception: it is the actual artwork for
# document-library.html (the 56-document production library browser).
/*.png
!/document-library-*.png
/document-thumbs/
